### 7.1 Create session (iva + maria)
# В отговора ще получиш sessionId (GUID). Копирай го и го сложи в @sessionId по-долу.
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenIva}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "Movie",
  "friendUserNames": ["maria"]
}

### 7.2 Set session id (Постави тук копирания GUID от create)
@sessionId = 354e283d-453f-4fc0-b9e3-e4fcb611469f


### PUT Movie filters
PUT {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/filters/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenIva}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Genres": ["Drama", "Comedy"],
  "MinRating": 7.5,
  "YearFrom": 1990,
  "YearTo": 2024
}


### GET My Movie filters
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/filters/movies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenIva}}
Accept: application/json


### GET Merged Movie filters
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/filters/movies/merged
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenIva}}
Accept: application/json



